{
  "_readme": "Part names for autocomplete in Add part. One array per kind: BLADE, RATCHET, BIT, LOCK_CHIP, MAIN_BLADE, ASSIST_BLADE, METAL_BLADE, OVER_BLADE. Each entry: name (required), code (ratchet like 9-60, bit like GF, assist blade letter like S, over blade letter like B), type (ATTACK, DEFENSE, STAMINA or BALANCE, blades, main blades and metal blades only), leftSpin (true or false), builtInRatchet (true on blades with an integrated ratchet, e.g. Bullet Griffon, whose combo has no ratchet: \"Bullet Griffon H\"), builtInBit (true on RATCHET entries that include the bit, e.g. Turbo \"Tr\", whose combo has no separate bit: \"Pegasus Blast ATr\"). CX combos use either a MAIN_BLADE or a METAL_BLADE + OVER_BLADE (Expand Blade), never both; Expand Blade combo order is Lock Chip + Metal Blade, then Over Blade code, Assist Blade code, ratchet, bit, e.g. \"Bahamut Blitz BK1-50I\". Example entry: {\"name\": \"Example Blade\", \"type\": \"ATTACK\"}. Keys starting with _ are ignored. Rebuild the app after editing.",
  "_generated": "2026-11-07",
